  "description": "Positioned in a well-established complex, this freshly updated two-bedroom townhouse offers comfortable living across two levels, with generous indoor spaces and a private outdoor courtyard.<br/><br/>The ground floor features a spacious open-plan living and dining area with plenty of natural light, flowing through to a functional kitchen complete with ample storage and bench space. Upstairs, both bedrooms are generously sized and include built-in storage, serviced by a modern bathroom.<br/><br/>Outside, enjoy a low-maintenance private courtyard, providing a great space to relax or entertain.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/><br/>2 spacious bedrooms<br/>1 bathroom<br/>Open-plan living and dining area<br/>Well-appointed kitchen with ample cupboard space<br/>Split-level townhouse design<br/>Built-in storage<br/>Private courtyard<br/>Low-maintenance living<br/>Convenient location close to shops, public transport, parks and local amenities<br/><br/>Important Information:<br/><br/>Initial lease term available is 6 months only<br/>External improvement works are scheduled to be carried out at the property/complex during the tenancy. Some minor disruption may occur from time to time while works are completed.<br/><br/>Situated in the heart of Maylands, this property offers easy access to local cafes, shopping, public transport and the Perth CBD, making it an excellent choice for those seeking both convenience and value.<br/><br/>Register your interest online to be notified of upcoming home open times.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Please note that external improvement and maintenance works are scheduled to be carried out during the tenancy. While every effort will be made to minimise disruption, contractors may require access to external areas of the property from time to time. The property is being offered with an initial 6-month lease term only while these works are completed. Prospective tenants are encouraged to consider this when applying.",
